          "explanation": "\"Galão\" is Portugal's iconic milky coffee — breakfast in a glass."
        },
        {
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "prompt": "How do you say \"I would like\"?",
          "options": ["Queria", "Quero muito", "Quererei", "Quis"],
