          "wordBank": ["pastel", "pão", "sopa", "salada"],
          "explanation": "\"Pastel de nata\" is the custard tart — order it with everything."
        },
        {
          "type": "listening",
          "text": "Para levar",
          "options": ["To take away", "To drink here", "For the table", "Right away"],
          "correctIndex": 0,
          "explanation": "\"Para levar\" — takeaway; \"para aqui\" means to stay."
        },
        {
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "prompt": "How do you say \"with milk\"?",
          "options": ["com leite", "com açúcar", "com gelo", "com água"],
          "correctIndex": 0,
          "explanation": "\"Com leite\" — with milk. \"Meia de leite\" is half coffee, half milk."
        },
        {
          "type": "fill_blank",
          "sentence": "Quer ___ café?",
          "answer": "um",
          "wordBank": ["um", "dois", "dez", "cem"],
          "explanation": "\"Quer um café?\" — would you like a coffee? Hospitality in one line."
        },
        {
          "type": "pronunciation",
          "expected": "Um café, por favor",
          "translation": "A coffee, please",
          "explanation": "The first phrase every café visit needs."
        }
      ]
    },
